cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AegisQDA — local-first, fail-closed privacy gateway for qualitative data"
abstract: >-
  Local-only anonymisation gateway that prepares interview transcripts for
  analysis: Presidio-backed recognition of personal data, mandatory signed
  human review, typed document-local surrogates and a second verification
  scan. Data is released to a downstream QDA adapter only after explicit
  sign-off. No cloud, no telemetry, no auto-approve. German, English, French.
type: software
